;;; `case`s of many data, searched by halving (`TODO.md` §46): integers by
;;; value, symbols and strings by their hashes; with a clause per datum and an
;;; atom `else` (the bodies at the leaves), and with clauses of two data or an
;;; `else` that is not one atom (an index, then the body by a second search).
;;; Each datum and some keys that are none, summed, a function at a time.
